  "description": "CR 608.2c, 111.1, 603.2, 702.15b, 611.2c, 514.2: Circle of Power draws two and loses 2 life, creates a 0/1 black Wizard whose noncreature-spell trigger deals 1 damage to each opponent, then gives the Wizards you control, that token included, +1/+0 and lifelink until end of turn",
  "note": "The token is created before the group effect resolves, so it is a 1/1 with lifelink, and its trigger off alice's Lightning Bolt hits bob 13 to 12 and carol 11 to 10 while alice gains the 2 back, 18 to 20, with the Bolt still on the stack. Her Prodigal Sorcerer is a Wizard and grows; her Hill Giant is not and does not; bob's Prodigal Sorcerer is a Wizard she does not control and does not. Her Grizzly Bears is a creature spell and bob's Shock is an opponent's spell; neither triggers it. In bob's upkeep both Wizards are back to their printed size without lifelink, and alice's Shock at carol makes the token hit bob 12 to 11 and carol 10 to 9 while alice stays at 20: the damage reaches no one but her opponents and gains her nothing once the turn has ended.",
